      "question_type": "solution",
      "section_heading_before": "",
      "question_markdown": "16. (15分) 设集合 $A=\\{x|(x-a+2)(x-a-2)<0\\}$，$B=\\left\\{x\\left|\\frac{2x-1}{x+2}<1\\right.\\right\\}$。\n(1) 求集合 A, B；\n(2) 若 $A\\cap(\\complement_R B)=\\varnothing$，求实数 a 的取值范围。",
      "question_review": {
        "status": "reviewed_via_api2_atomic_patch",
        "source_context_ids": [
          "C001"
        ],
        "recognition_profile_version": "symbol_profile_v1",
        "lint_actions": [
          "applied_solution_edit_1_insert_missing"
        ],
        "context_manifest": "/home/puppeteer/MathOCRClaw/benchmark/runs/20260827-163923/workflow/page15/code_outputs/match/question_contexts.json"
      },
      "handwritten_answer": {
        "text": "(1) 由题意得 $a-2, a+2$ 是方程 $(x-a+2)(x-a-2)=0$ 的两根，且 $a-2$ 一定小于 $a+2$.\n$\\therefore A=\\{x|a-2<x<a+2\\}$.\n$B$: ① $\\begin{cases} x+2>0 \\\\ 2x-1<x+2 \\end{cases}$ 解得 $-2<x<3$\n② $\\begin{cases} 2x-1>x+2 \\\\ x+2<0 \\end{cases}$ 无解.\n$\\therefore B=\\{x|-2<x<3\\}$\n(2) $\\complement_R B=\\{x|x\\le-2 \\text{ 或 } x\\ge 3\\}$.\n$\\because A\\cap(\\complement_R B)=\\varnothing$\n① $A=\\varnothing \\Rightarrow a-2 \\ge a+2$ 无解.\n② $\\begin{cases} a-2 > -2 \\\\ a+2 < 3 \\end{cases}$ 解得 $0 < a < 1$\n综上所述，a 取值 $\\{a|0<a<1\\}$",
        "answer_parts": [],
